10
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:28,162
- [Pearl] I'll get you!

11
00:00:29,097 --> 00:00:32,233
♪ I'll send him cheesy movies ♪

12
00:00:32,233 --> 00:00:34,368
♪ The worst I can find ♪

13
00:00:34,368 --> 00:00:35,403
♪ La la la ♪

14
00:00:35,403 --> 00:00:38,238
♪ He'll have to sit and watch them all ♪

15
00:00:38,238 --> 00:00:40,708
♪ And I'll monitor his mind ♪

16
00:00:40,708 --> 00:00:41,708
