31
00:01:12,340 --> 00:01:15,477
♪ I should really just relax ♪

32
00:01:15,477 --> 00:01:19,713
♪ For Mystery Science Theater 3000 ♪

33
00:01:23,150 --> 00:01:25,387
(slamming)

34
00:01:26,922 --> 00:01:28,088
(beeping)

35
00:01:28,088 --> 00:01:30,258
(buzzing)

36
00:01:35,197 --> 00:01:36,030
- Hi everyone.

37
00:01:36,030 --> 00:01:37,432
Welcome to the satellite of love.

38
00:01:37,432 --> 00:01:40,067
As you can, see there's
been some changes in Thomas.

39
00:01:40,067 --> 00:01:41,568
A little difficult to explain so--

40
00:01:41,568 --> 00:01:43,303
- Oh, not difficult at all, Mike.

41
00:01:43,303 --> 00:01:46,273
Acting on same ancient urge
imprinted in my very genes,

42
00:01:46,273 --> 00:01:47,908
a few days ago I wriggled my way

43
00:01:47,908 --> 00:01:50,478
onto a twig and began
squeezing a thin stream

44
00:01:50,478 --> 00:01:52,147
of liquid from my spinnerette

45
00:01:52,147 --> 00:01:54,648
which I turned into a soft button of silk.

46
00:01:54,648 --> 00:01:56,985
Then using wave like movements of my body,

47
00:01:56,985 --> 00:01:58,720
I rolled my skin off toward my rear

48
00:01:58,720 --> 00:02:00,822
exposing the soft front
parts of the pupa--

49
00:02:00,822 --> 00:02:02,690
- Okay, okay, okay, alright.

50
00:02:02,690 --> 00:02:03,525
The point is--

51
00:02:03,525 --> 00:02:05,627
- I'm a butterfly and
a glorious one at that.

52
00:02:05,627 --> 00:02:07,928
- Right, so the Tom Servo
we've all known and loved--

53
00:02:07,928 --> 00:02:09,297
- Oh, nothing but a larva, Mike,

54
00:02:09,297 --> 00:02:10,965
and it was a surprise to me too.

55
00:02:10,965 --> 00:02:12,733
Hell, I didn't even
know I had a spinnerette

56
00:02:12,733 --> 00:02:14,368
until I began squeezing that thin stream

57
00:02:14,368 --> 00:02:15,203
of liquid, you know?

58
00:02:15,203 --> 00:02:16,703
- Okay, enough with the thin stream.

59
00:02:16,703 --> 00:02:19,207
Now the coloring, is that
a camouflage of some sort?

60
00:02:19,207 --> 00:02:21,275
- Uh yeah, well, unfortunately I blend in

61
00:02:21,275 --> 00:02:22,410
only with myself, Mike.

62
00:02:22,410 --> 00:02:23,845
Makes me incredibly susceptible

63
00:02:23,845 --> 00:02:25,513
to being eaten by a barn swallow.

64
00:02:25,513 --> 00:02:27,348
I tend to survive only a day or two.

65
00:02:27,348 --> 00:02:28,717
- Yeah well, until that happens I

66
00:02:28,717 --> 00:02:30,117
whipped up a little nectar for you.

67
00:02:30,117 --> 00:02:30,952
Here you go.

68
00:02:30,952 --> 00:02:32,020
- Oh boy.

69
00:02:32,020 --> 00:02:34,555
(whistling)

70
00:02:34,555 --> 00:02:36,925
Hey, my proboscis
doubles as a party favor.

71
00:02:36,925 --> 00:02:37,758
- Neat.

72
00:02:37,758 --> 00:02:38,593
We'll be right back.

73
00:02:38,593 --> 00:02:39,427
- Give me some.

74
00:02:40,562 --> 00:02:42,163
That's good nectar.

75
00:02:43,297 --> 00:02:45,867
(upbeat music)

76
00:02:52,573 --> 00:02:53,808
- Hey, Servo.

77
00:02:53,808 --> 00:02:54,642
What happened to your--

78
00:02:54,642 --> 00:02:56,243
- I'm still a beautiful butterfly, Mike.

79
00:02:56,243 --> 00:02:58,312
I've had a few unfortunate happenstances

80
00:02:58,312 --> 00:03:01,548
such as my wings being torn
off in an industrial accident.

81
00:03:01,548 --> 00:03:03,685
That depressed me so I
ate a lot of Mallomars

82
00:03:03,685 --> 00:03:05,085
and gained all the weight back.

83
00:03:05,085 --> 00:03:06,220
But I was soon feeling better

84
00:03:06,220 --> 00:03:08,255
and went back to work but alas, someone

85
00:03:08,255 --> 00:03:10,592
turned on the extruitar
while I was cleaning it

86
00:03:10,592 --> 00:03:12,727
and my bottom two pairs
of delicate butterfly legs

87
00:03:12,727 --> 00:03:13,928
were ripped from me.

88
00:03:13,928 --> 00:03:16,797
Again depressed, I hit
the pecan sandies hard

89
00:03:16,797 --> 00:03:18,332
and gained my remaining weight back

90
00:03:18,332 --> 00:03:19,867
and my remaining arms.

91
00:03:19,867 --> 00:03:21,835
Arms by now in a metabolic frenzy

92
00:03:21,835 --> 00:03:23,638
