93
00:03:23,638 --> 00:03:26,207
which made them so thin as to be invisible

94
00:03:26,207 --> 00:03:28,142
but I am still a
beautiful butterfly, Mike,

95
00:03:28,142 --> 00:03:30,778
and butterflies are free to fly.

96
00:03:30,778 --> 00:03:34,682
Fly away, high away, bye bye.

97
00:03:36,417 --> 00:03:38,587
(humming)

98
00:03:39,653 --> 00:03:41,122
- Well makes sense.

99
00:03:41,122 --> 00:03:42,390
- And I still have my proboscis.

100
00:03:42,390 --> 00:03:45,025
- Ah, right.

101
00:03:45,025 --> 00:03:47,128
Oh, Pearl's calling.

102
00:03:47,128 --> 00:03:48,597
And it seems urgent.

103
00:03:48,597 --> 00:03:49,897
Yes, Ms. Forrester.

104
00:03:52,700 --> 00:03:54,968
- [Pearl] Mike, what are you doing?

105
00:03:54,968 --> 00:03:56,003
