school training

127
00:04:34,808 --> 00:04:36,877
so we have to suffer for it.

128
00:04:36,877 --> 00:04:37,712
- Exactly.

129
00:04:37,712 --> 00:04:40,247
That's why it's your fault we don't

130
00:04:40,247 --> 00:04:41,315
