517
00:22:06,627 --> 00:22:08,795
- Jenni, this is Mickey.

518
00:22:08,795 --> 00:22:11,297
- Mickey's a wide awake nightmare.

519
00:22:11,297 --> 00:22:12,565
- How do you do, Mickey?

520
00:22:12,565 --> 00:22:14,067
I hope we'll be good friends.

521
00:22:15,102 --> 00:22:16,737
- Well, Mickey?

522
00:22:17,670 --> 00:22:19,707
